    LLM: 'Game: Strip Poker. Logic: See rules.',
    Player: 'Poker variant where losers remove clothing. Social/stakes variant of standard poker.',
    objective: 'Win the pot by having the highest-ranking five-card poker hand at showdown or by forcing all other players to fold. In strip poker, losers remove clothing (or stakes can be chips and clothing).',
    gameplay: 'Play is the same as five-card draw: deal five cards, first betting round, discard and draw (0 to 5 cards), second betting round, showdown. Stakes can be chips only, clothing only, or a combination; losers remove an item per lost hand or when out of chips.',
